.InjectHTML" class="OSBlockWidget" id="b18-l1-5862_2686-b7-$b2"><div data-container="" id="b18-l1-5862_2686-b7-b2-InjectHTMLWrapper">Sucessão do Estado</div></div></div></div></div><div data-container="" class="fragmento-full-width OSInline"><div data-block="LegislacaoConsolidada.FragmentoDetailTextoCompleto" class="OSBlockWidget" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-$b7"><div data-container="" class="Fragmento_Titulo" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-C_Titulo"><span data-expression="" class="tituloletters">Artigo 2152.º</span></div><div data-container="" class="Fragmento_Epigrafe" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-C_Epigrafe"><div data-block="HTMLInject.InjectHTML" class="OSBlockWidget" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-$b2"><div data-container="" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-b2-InjectHTMLWrapper">(Chamamento do Estado)</div></div></div><div data-block="LegislacaoConsolidada.EntradaEmVigor" class="OSBlockWidget" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-$b3"></div><div data-container="" class="Fragmento_Texto diploma-fragmento int int-links"><div data-block="HTMLInject.InjectHTML" class="OSBlockWidget" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-$b5"><div data-container="" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-b5-InjectHTMLWrapper"><div>Na falta de cônjuge e de todos os parentes sucessíveis, é chamado à herança o Estado.</div></div></div></div><div data-container="" class="alteracoesContainer" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-Alteracoes"><div data-block="LegislacaoConsolidada.AlteracoesByFragmentoId" class="OSBlockWidget" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-$b7"><div data-container="" class="VerTodasAlteracoesGeneralContainer"><div data-container="" class="AlteracoesListContainer"><div data-list="" class="list list-group OSFillParent" style="position: relative;"><script style="display: flex; height: 0px; width: 100%;"></script><div data-container="" class="textoalt texto-alteracao-container"><div data-block="HTMLInject.InjectHTML" class="OSBlockWidget" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-b7-l1-5403_0-$b1"><div data-container="" id="b18-l1-5862_2687-b7-b7-l1-5403_0-b1-InjectHTMLWrapper">Alterado pe